# Project notes — root .md files stay local by default. Tracked exceptions:
# README, REFERENCES, RELEASE_NOTES (frozen quarry log), plus the redesign
# guardrails CLAUDE.md and the new-tree CHANGELOG.md. The redesign/ design
# workspace (artifacts + ledger + handoffs) is a sub-directory, so it is tracked
# and is NOT affected by this root /*.md anchor. Old audit ledgers, plans, ideas
# and module-health trackers remain local.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/REFERENCES.md
!/RELEASE_NOTES.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/OPEN.md

# Local-only archive of closed audit ledgers + pre-audit historical plans.
# Moved out of repo root for visual cleanliness on 2026-06-19 after the
# v1.119 audit-chain closure. Restore from here if a future session needs
# them; nothing in archive is referenced by active code or tests.
.archive/
